Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Finance Exception Intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,财务异常智能。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Review monthly status.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,查看月度监控状态。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:04.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Open Freight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:04.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,打开 Freight 预警。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:07.00,EN,,0,0,0,,A possible duplicate allocation needs finance review.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:07.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,可能存在重复分摊，需财务核实。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:11.89,EN,,0,0,0,,Identify records, correct duplicates, rerun, and validate Freight and GP.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:11.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,识别记录，修正重复分摊，重新运行，并验证 Freight 与毛利。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.89,0:00:21.77,EN,,0,0,0,,Review revenue, cost, and cost credit trends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.89,0:00:21.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,查看收入、成本和成本抵减趋势。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.77,0:00:23.93,EN,,0,0,0,,Open Service allocation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.77,0:00:23.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,打开 Service allocation。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.93,0:00:26.09,EN,,0,0,0,,GA shows negative month-three gross profit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.93,0:00:26.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,GA 第三个月毛利为负。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.09,0:00:32.67,EN,,0,0,0,,Ask why gross profit turned negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.09,0:00:32.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,询问毛利为什么转为负数。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.67,0:00:39.25,EN,,0,0,0,,Follow the rules, true-up, revenue base, and source evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.67,0:00:39.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,依次追踪规则、轧差、收入基数和源凭证。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.25,0:00:41.78,EN,,0,0,0,,Open the negative revenue voucher.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.25,0:00:41.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,打开负收入凭证。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.78,0:00:44.30,EN,,0,0,0,,Check amount, segment, user and reference.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.78,0:00:44.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,核对金额、segment、入账人和参考号。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.30,0:00:46.83,EN,,0,0,0,,No matching positive entry is confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.30,0:00:46.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,本样例尚未确认匹配的正向凭证。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.83,0:00:51.55,EN,,0,0,0,,Compare excluding the voucher from the allocation base only.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.83,0:00:51.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,比较仅将凭证排除在分摊基数之外的方案。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.55,0:00:56.27,EN,,0,0,0,,Posted revenue and months one and two stay unchanged.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.55,0:00:56.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,已入账收入和前两个月的分摊结果不变。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.27,0:01:00.98,EN,,0,0,0,,GA improves, total gross profit is unchanged, and LE remains under review.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.27,0:01:00.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,GA 改善，但总毛利不变，LE 仍待核查。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.98,0:01:07.19,EN,,0,0,0,,Save the candidate and generate a report with evidence, assumptions, and actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.98,0:01:07.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,保存候选方案，生成包含证据、假设和行动的报告。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.19,0:01:13.94,EN,,0,0,0,,Create a follow-up task from the same saved proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.19,0:01:13.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,从同一已保存方案创建后续任务。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.94,0:01:17.69,EN,,0,0,0,,Assign an owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.94,0:01:17.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,分派负责人。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.69,0:01:21.43,EN,,0,0,0,,The assignee receives the task and starts work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.69,0:01:21.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,被指派人接收任务并开始工作。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.43,0:01:25.18,EN,,0,0,0,,Track each handoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.43,0:01:25.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,追踪每次交接。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.18,0:01:27.15,EN,,0,0,0,,Record the outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.18,0:01:27.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,记录处理结果。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.15,0:01:29.11,EN,,0,0,0,,Task completion does not change the ledger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.15,0:01:29.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,任务完成不改变账务。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.11,0:01:37.05,EN,,0,0,0,,Ask about report logic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.11,0:01:37.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,询问报表逻辑。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.05,0:01:44.99,EN,,0,0,0,,The simulated answer streams from the selected knowledge base and links to its source.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.05,0:01:44.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,模拟答案从所选知识库流式展示，并链接原文。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.99,0:01:49.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Explore built-in and personal knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.99,0:01:49.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,查看内置和个人知识库。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.00,0:01:56.19,EN,,0,0,0,,Choose a report, dimension and metric.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.00,0:01:56.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,选择报表、维度和指标。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.19,0:02:03.37,EN,,0,0,0,,Describe a monitor, then configure a gross-profit benchmark.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.19,0:02:03.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,描述监控需求，再设置毛利阈值。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.37,0:02:14.47,EN,,0,0,0,,Add revenue trends, configure signals, rearrange cards, and reuse templates in Monitor Market.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.37,0:02:14.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,添加收入趋势、配置信号、拖动卡片，并从 Monitor Market 复用模板。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.47,0:02:16.13,EN,,0,0,0,,Finance Exception Intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.47,0:02:16.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,财务异常智能。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.13,0:02:17.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Sample data.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.13,0:02:17.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,样例数据。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.80,0:02:19.47,EN,,0,0,0,,Simulated AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.80,0:02:19.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,模拟 AI。
